        "UOC-002 adds parsed frontmatter, SHA-256, typed Git status/history/diff, memory-only full-text search and workspace-scoped document links.",
        "The browser uses opaque document ids; absolute filesystem paths and free-form Git commands are never accepted as authority.",
        "UOC-003 exposes deterministic validation jobs and explicit-only traceability in the same read-only document inspection context.",
        "UOC-004 remains plan-only: immutable proposal, full diff, optimistic recheck and non-executed patch export.",
        "UOC-005 remains the narrow approval-bound document apply/rollback boundary.",
        "UOC-006 adds a separate governed Git panel: typed status/history/compare, immutable staging/commit plan, exact stage approval, exact staging, second commit approval, explicit-identity local commit, and controlled local branch-ref creation.",
        "The browser never supplies free Git arguments or absolute path authority. reset --hard, rebase, push/force-push, branch deletion, checkout/switch, tags and repository hooks remain blocked.",
        "UOC-011: route participates in the 12-state operational browser hardening matrix.",
        "GSDLC-04-B adds MANUAL Markdown/JSON runtime draft authoring, autosave, immutable history, discard/recover and optimistic concurrency; draft save never writes approved source.",
        "GSDLC-04-C adds preview-first PASTE/UPLOAD/IMPORT with original+normalized hashes, provenance and DRAFT-only runtime persistence; URL/reference is metadata and is never fetched.",
        "GSDLC-04-D composes ArtifactProfile validation, navigable findings, immutable plan/diff, exact targeted approval, UOC-005 atomic apply, freeze hash and drift invalidation; UI never becomes approval authority.",
